          ClassType1: TEXT
          String: |-
            Set the size attribute to be a random value between Size Min and Size Max.
            
            Size Mode - "Explicit" sets the particle size directly. 
            Size Mode - "Normalize to AABB" scales the particle size to the render mesh's AABB, useful when working with custom meshes.
